    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagira Arooni ati: Iwe na batabani baawe n'eka ya sho muryabuuzibwa byona ebiriba byashobire omu by'Omwanya ogurikwera; iwe na batabani baawe niimwe muribuuzibwa ebiriba byashobire omu bunyamurwa bwanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.3.6+NUM.3.7+NUM.3.8+NUM.3.9+NUM.3.10+NUM.3.11+NUM.3.12+NUM.3.13+NUM.3.14+NUM.3.15+NUM.3.16+NUM.3.17+NUM.3.18+NUM.3.19+NUM.3.20+NUM.3.21+NUM.3.22+NUM.3.23+NUM.3.24+NUM.3.25+NUM.3.26+NUM.3.27+NUM.3.28+NUM.3.29+NUM.3.30+NUM.3.31+NUM.3.32+NUM.3.33+NUM.3.34+NUM.3.35+NUM.3.36+NUM.3.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 3:6-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi na beene waanyu ab'oruganda rwa Leevi oruganda rwa shwenkuru, obairize haihi naiwe, bagume bakwatanise naiwe, bakuheereze; kwonka iwe na batabani baawe niimwe muriguma omu maisho g'Eihema ry'Ebirikuhamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagume nibooroobera ebi orikubaragiira, kandi bakwatsibwe eby'Eihema byona, kwonka batariirira haihi n'ebintu by'Omwanya ogurikwera n'eitambiro, imwe nabo mutakaafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakwatanise naiwe, kandi bakwatsibwe eby'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu ahabw'omurimo gw'obuheereza bwaryo bwona; otari w'omuribo atariirira haihi naimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.1.53"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 1:53",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Niimwe mwakwatsibwa eby'Omwanya ogurikwera n'eitambiro, Abaisraeli barekye kugaruka kugirirwa ekiniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi reeba, nyihire beene waanyu Abaleevi omu Baisraeli; ahariimwe n'ekiconco ekihairwe MUKAMA okukora omurimo gw'obuheereza omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 9:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka iwe na batabani baawe mugume nimukora omurimo gw'obunyamurwa ogurikukwata aha buri kintu kyona eky'aha itambiro, n'ahari byona ebiri omunda y'omukingo; egyo niyo mirimo ei muraagume nimukora. Naabaha obunyamurwa nk'ekiconco; otari w'omuriimwe oribyetaasyamu, aryaitwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
