        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 6:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.6.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagira Arooni ati: Nyowe nyenka naakukwatsa eby'empongano byona ebibiikirwe, ebi mpongyeirwe, byona ebi Abaisraeli baanyereza; naabikuha kuba omugabo gwawe na batabani baawe okuba ekiragiro ky'ebiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi ebitarikwokibwa aha birikwera munonga bibe ebyawe; buri mpongano yaabo yoona, buri mpongano yaabo ey'esaano, buri kitambo kyabo eky'ekibi, na buri kitambo kyabo eky'okubaihisaho orubanja rw'ekibi, ebi barimpongyera, biryaba ebirikwera munonga ahabwawe na batabani baawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogume obiriire aharikwera munonga, orikwetwa omushaija weena omuriimwe abe niwe yaabiryaho; biryakubeera ebirikwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.7.30+LEV.7.31+LEV.7.32+LEV.7.33+LEV.7.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 7:30-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 18:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ebi nabyo n'ebyawe; empongano zaabo ezi bahayo ahabw'okweyendera, empongano zoona ezizongazongiibwe ez'Abaisraeli, naazikuha na batabani baawe na bahara baawe kuba omugabo gwanyu ogw'ebiro byona; buri muntu weena ow'omu ka yaawe oshemeire aryaguma aziryeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi amajuta agarikukira oburungi goona, na viinyo erikukira oburungi yoona, n'engano ezirikukira oburungi zoona, n'emiganuro yaabyo ei bariguma nibareetera MUKAMA, niiwe naabiha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebijuma byona ebiriguma nibibanza kwera omu nsi yaabo, ebi bareetera MUKAMA, biryaba ebyawe; buri muntu weena ow'omu ka yaawe oshemeire aryaguma abiryeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekintu kyona ekiriheerwayo kimwe omuri Israeli kiryaba ekyawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 13:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Emijigaijo yoona ey'ebiine omubiri byona ebi bahongyera MUKAMA, yaaba y'abantu nari ey'enyamaishwa, egume ebe eyaawe; kwonka emijigaijo y'abantu otaribura kugicungura, kandi emijigaijo y'enyamaishwa ezirikuzira nayo oryagicungura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 30:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebishemereire kucungurwa aharibyo okutandikira aha bihikize okwezi, bicungurwe obuguzi bwa shekeli itaano obu oricwa, nka shekeli ey'Omwanya ogurikwera oku eri, (nizo geera makumi abiri). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka emijigaijo y'ente nari ey'entaama nari ey'embuzi otarigicungura; emijigaijo yaazo n'erikwera; oryaguma oshukyere eitambiro eshagama yaayo, oyotsye ebishaju byayo kuba empongano eyokiibwe omu muriro, ey'ekisooroora kirungi ahari MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka enyama yaayo ey'enkoro ezongazongiibwe, n'ey'ekivune ky'okuguru kwa buryo eryaguma ebe eyaawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Empongano zoona ezirikwera ezi Abaisraeli bahongyera MUKAMA, naazikuha na batabani baawe, kuba omugabo gwanyu ogw'ebiro byona; n'endagaano ey'ebiro byona eraganisibwa omwonyo omu maisho ga MUKAMA ahariiwe n'oruzaaro rwawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.73.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 73:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi MUKAMA yaagira Arooni ati: Iwe torigira buhunguzi omu nsi y'Abaisraeli, n'obu gwakuba omugabo gwona omuribo; niinye mugabo gwawe n'obuhunguzi bwawe omu Baisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
