              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Abaleevi naabaha ebicweka byona ebya kimwe kya ikumi ebi Abaisraeli barikuha kuba obuhunguzi bwabo ahabw'omurimo gwabo gw'obuheereza, ogu barikukora omu Ihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi okuruga hati Abaisraeli batariirira haihi n'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, bakagiibwaho ekibi, bakafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kureka Abaleevi babe nibo baakora omurimo gw'obuheereza ogw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, kandi babe nibo baagumwaho orubanja rw'okutahikiirira. Kibe ekiragiro ekitarihwaho ebiro byona omu busingye bwanyu bwona; kandi batarigira obuhunguzi omu Baisraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabw'okuba ebicweka bya kimwe kya ikumi ebi Abaisraeli barireeta kuhongyera MUKAMA, naabiha Abaleevi kub obuhunguzi bwabo; nikyo naabagambirira ku batarigira buhunguzi omu Baisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
