          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.10.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 10:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ogambire Abaleevi oti: Ku muriiha aha Baisraeli kimwe kya ikumi, eki mbahaire kuba obuhunguzi bwanyu, naimwe mugume mukiiheho kimwe kya ikumi kuba empongano y'okuhongyera MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egyo mpongano eryababarirwa nk'ey'engano erugire aha mbuga y'okuhuuriraho, kandi nk'eya viinyo enyuukirwe omu icwa ryona ery'emizaabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo mube nikwo mwaguma nimuhongyera MUKAMA empongano ezi mwihire aha bicweka byanyu byona ebya kimwe kya ikumi eki muriiha aha Baisraeli. Kandi aharibyo mugume mwiheho empongano y'okuhongyera MUKAMA, mugihe Arooni omunyamurwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha biconco byona ebi muriheebwa, mugume muheyo empongano eshemereire kuhongyerwa MUKAMA, nimugiiha aha birikukira oburungi, nimuhayo ebicweka byabyo ebyeziibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo obagire oti: Ku muriguma mwaheza kuhonga ebicweka byabyo ebirikukira oburungi, ebiritsigaraho biryabarirwa Abaleevi nk'ekirugire aha mbuga ey'okuhuuriraho, kandi nka viinyo erugire omu inyuukiro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
